<LanguageData>
  <Settlers_Wanted.questDescriptionAndNameRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: questName->Bounty: [nameFull] [nickname]-->
    <li>questName-&gt;赏金：[nameFull] [nickname]</li>
    <!--EN: questName->Wanted, Dead or Alive: [nickname]-->
    <li>questName-&gt;生死通缉：[nickname]</li>
    <!--EN: questName->[nickname]'s brigands-->
    <li>questName-&gt;[nickname]的强盗</li>
    <!--EN: questDescription->[asker_nameFull], [asker_faction_leaderTitle] of [asker_faction_name] hails us. Apparently, the notorious [criminal_nameFull] of [siteFaction_name] is hiding out in our vicinity.
\n[asker_nameDef] is asking us to bring [nickname] to one of their settlements for a grand sum of [bounty] silver, double if alive. They are hiding in a safe house and it's probably guarded.
\nIf we clear out their camp, [allRewardsDescriptions]-->
    <li>questDescription-&gt;[asker_nameFull]、[asker_faction_name] 的 [asker_faction_leaderTitle] 向我们致敬。显然，臭名昭著的 [siteFaction_name] 的 [criminal_nameFull] 就藏在我们附近。

[asker_nameDef] 要求我们将 [nickname] 带到他们的一个定居点，以获取一大笔 [bounty] 银子，如果活着的话，银子是双倍的。他们躲在一个安全屋里，而且可能有人看守。

如果我们清理掉他们的营地，[allRewardsDescriptions]</li>
  </Settlers_Wanted.questDescriptionAndNameRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: Quest expired: [resolvedQuestName]-->
  <Settlers_Wanted.root.nodes.11.node.nodes.0.label>任务已过期：[resolvedQuestName]</Settlers_Wanted.root.nodes.11.node.nodes.0.label>
  <!--EN: [criminal_nameFull] heard about their compromised position thus have decided to leave the area. The quest [resolvedQuestName] has expired.-->
  <Settlers_Wanted.root.nodes.11.node.nodes.0.text>[criminal_nameFull] 听说他们的立场受到损害，因此决定离开该地区。任务 [resolvedQuestName] 已过期。</Settlers_Wanted.root.nodes.11.node.nodes.0.text>
  <!--EN: Quest failed: [resolvedQuestName]-->
  <Settlers_Wanted.root.nodes.12.node.nodes.0.label>任务失败：[resolvedQuestName]</Settlers_Wanted.root.nodes.12.node.nodes.0.label>
  <!--EN: The brigands has packed up and moved on.-->
  <Settlers_Wanted.root.nodes.12.node.nodes.0.text>强盗们已经收拾行装继续前行。</Settlers_Wanted.root.nodes.12.node.nodes.0.text>
  <VFES_CaravanRaid.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: questDescription->[asker_nameFull], [asker_faction_leaderTitle] of [asker_faction_name], has sent us a message. Apparently, [siteFaction_pawnsPlural] are resting with their beasts before continuing their journey.
            \n[asker_nameDef] gave us their location, if we want to, we can go attack them.-->
    <li>[asker_faction_name] 的 questDescription-&gt;[asker_nameFull]、[asker_faction_leaderTitle] 向我们发送了一条消息。显然，[siteFaction_pawnsPlural]正在和他们的野兽一起休息，然后继续他们的旅程。
 
[asker_nameDef]给了我们他们的位置，如果我们愿意，我们可以去攻击他们。</li>
  </VFES_CaravanRaid.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
